Language Clinic Close About Laurentian University Learn about Laurentian University’s mission, leadership, and initiatives. Learn about Laurentian University Menu News Careers Contact Us Campus Maps Governance & Leadership Policies & Accountability Office of Sustainability Facts & Figures News News Social Media Events Student Stories Careers Careers Administrative Vacancies Faculty Vacancies Governance & Leadership Governance & Leadership Board of Governors Chancellor General Counsel LUNEC Leadership Planning President Senate President Listening Tour Policies & Accountability Policies & Accountability Finance and Budget Academic Accountability AODA at Laurentian University Copyright Notice of Collection Policies Policy on the Freedom of Speech Procurement and Contracts Purchasing Policy Office of Sustainability Office of Sustainability Laurentian Greenspace Global Lessons from the Restoration Story of Sudbury, Canada Laurentian's Nature Positive University Close Information for... Menu Future Students Future International Students Current Students Current International Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents & Counselors Donors Close Research Learn more about Research at Laurentian University Menu Research Research Centres Research Chairs & Fellows Funding Opportunities Highlights Our People Strategic Research Plan Animal Care and Lab-Bio Safety Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Ethics Intellectual Property & Commercialization Jim Fielding Innovation Space ROMEO Research Data Management Research Support Fund Qualtrics Menu Search Home About Laurentian Careers Careers at Laurentian University Staff Opportunities Build Impact, Drive Change View Staff Career Opportunities Faculty Opportunities Teach, Inspire, Lead View Faculty Career Opportunities Your Next Chapter Starts Here Move to Sudbury Learn more about Sudbury At Laurentian University, your work matters. This is a place where careers are built on purpose. Whether you're advancing research, supporting learners, or shaping the university’s next chapter, you’ll be part of a team driven by impact, resilience, and renewal. Our campus offers the best of both worlds: a close-knit, collaborative environment surrounded by the natural beauty of five lakes and endless trails — all just minutes from the city. Join us at a time of transformation, where your ideas, energy, and expertise can help shape what comes next. An Inclusive Workplace Laurentian University is committed to providing an inclusive and barrier free experience to applicants with accessibility needs. Requests for accommodation can be made at any stage during the recruitment process. Please contact the Human Resources and Organizational Development Office at careers@laurentian.ca for more information. Competitive Compensation At Laurentian University, we believe your contributions deserve to be recognized. That’s why we offer competitive compensation that rewards your expertise and experience. Comprehensive Benefits Our generous health benefits, including medical and dental coverage, ensure you and your family are well taken care of. With our robust pension plan, you’ll have the confidence that comes with financial security for retirement. Professional Development Opportunities At Laurentian, we invest in diverse professional development opportunities, from skill-building and stretch projects to leadership exposure, to help you grow your career and reach your full potential. A Bilingual and Tri-Cultural Workplace At Laurentian University, we’re proud to be the first university designated under the French-Language Services Act, reflecting our commitment to creating a truly bilingual workplace. As the only university in Canada with a Tri-Cultural Mandate, we honor our responsibility to the Atikameksheng Anishinaabek, the Indigenous people on whose land our institution is built. Our vibrant cultural diversity is a cornerstone of our workplace, and we are dedicated to creating an environment where every employee is respected, valued, and empowered. Whether you’re collaborating across departments, engaging in professional development, or participating in campus events, you’ll find an inclusive community where diverse perspectives are celebrated and all voices are heard. Continuous Learning & Education Take advantage of continuing education courses and tuition reimbursement for employees and immediate family, ensuring lifelong learning opportunities. Balance & Well Being From yoga and exercise programs to wellness initiatives, we encourage our employees to maintain a healthy lifestyle both inside and outside of work. Get active with access to award-winning intramural sports programs, a fitness center, and recreational facility discounts to keep you energized and engaged. An Adventure-Friendly Campus Our bicycle and pedestrian-friendly campus is a true haven for outdoor enthusiasts, featuring over 10 km of groomed trails. Whether you're taking a stroll or cycling through, you'll find a peaceful yet vibrant environment that encourages both relaxation and an active lifestyle. Discover More of Laurentian University Play video Explore Laurentian's Campus Skating on Ramsey Lake This is Laurentian University Apply to Laurentian University today! View all Staff Career Opportunities View all Faculty Career Opportunities Laurentian University 1.800.461.4030 705.675.1151 935 Ramsey Lake Road, Sudbury, ON P3E 2C6 Contact Us Social Media Visits and Tours Report a problem with the website Are You Okay? Accessibility Services Careers Directories Helpful Contacts News Land Acknowledgment - Aki Gaabijidebendaagwak We would like to acknowledge the Robinson-Huron Treaty of 1850. We also further recognize that Laurentian University is located on the traditional lands of the Atikameksheng Anishnawbek and that the City of Greater Sudbury, also includes the traditional lands of the Wahnapitae First Nation. We extend our deepest respect to Indigenous peoples - as a sign of our continued relationship we will support Laurentian University ’s Truth and Reconciliation Task Force Recommendations. Miigwech. Listen to it in Anishinaabemowin . Privacy Policy Accessibility Policy Sitemap Laurentian University. Sudbury, Ontario, Canada. All Rights Reserved. 2026 Close"
